@prefix : <http://example.org/orexis/world/hanoi#> .
@prefix orexis: <http://example.org/orexis#> .
@prefix planning: <http://example.org/orexis/planning#> .
@prefix execution: <http://example.org/orexis/execution#> .

<> a orexis:SelfGraph .    # this document is one graph, and this is what it is

#  WHO THIS AGENT IS: the agent solving the tower, and this document is its own by the self it
#  states. Booted as "hanoi", the agent checks that this is so.
#
#  WHAT IT RUNS: it plans the tower and walks the plan, in the packages' words, since no domain has
#  one for what it is. Its world ships no rules, so it is no deliberator.

:hanoi a orexis:Self , planning:Planner , execution:Executor .
